[6.406, "o", "\r\n\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m⏺\u001b[0m All 3 turns passed: the agent (1) correctly gated the order request behind identity verification, (2) accepted the email and prompted for a verification code, and (3) handled the manager-escalation by routing to a live service rep. No failures. Regression spec saved to `sfagent-reports/smoke-test.yaml` (3 cases), runnable via `sf agent test run-eval --spec sfagent-reports/smoke-test.yaml --target-org sfagent-dev`.\r\n\r\n"]
